      {
        "text": "管理层把 Google Cloud 的变化解释为收入大幅增长：2026 年第二季度及上半年，Google Cloud 收入分别同比增加 111 亿美元和 189 亿美元，主要由 Google Cloud Platform 增长推动，尤其是基础设施和平台服务；此外，公司表示 2026 年第二季度开始确认 TPU systems 销售收入。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
            "block_id": "block-000614-db3885c5",
            "quote": "Google Cloud revenues increased $11.1 billion and $18.9 billion"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
            "block_id": "block-000614-db3885c5",
            "quote": "primarily driven by growth in Google Cloud Platform largely from infrastructure and platform services"
          },
          {
            "document_id": "alphabet-000165204426000071",
            "index_id": "didx-1ef3e3b4f7ad7da5",
            "block_id": "block-000614-db3885c5",
            "quote": "we began recognizing revenue from the sale of TPU systems"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "这里的比较口径是 2025 年 6 月 30 日止三个月/六个月与 2026 年 6 月 30 日止三个月/六个月，不是公司成立或业务起点。",
